Package: foldbenchR
Title: Crease-Pattern Manifolds as Ground Truth for Dimension Reduction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Generates manifolds from rigid origami crease patterns, where the
    flat pattern is the exact low-dimensional embedding rather than an
    approximation of it. Provides pattern constructors, a folding and sampling
    interface parameterised by fold angle, product and lift constructions for
    higher intrinsic and ambient dimension, and evaluation metrics measured
    against the known truth.
